      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esterhazy%2C_Saskatchewan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Esterhazy Regional Park sits on Kaposvar Creek and offers a 9‑hole golf course, cross‑country trails, and a 32‑site campground with electric hookups.",
